        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Videoconference, laptop, participant, certified electricity mix
The data set represents average values for one videoconference using a laptop computer. ;
UUID: 621fd7a5-4db5-3a70-ba7e-c1bd20a5b843
This data set includes the use of hardware (laptop, internet devices) and energy consumption for on hour videoconference using broadband access per participant. Certified mix electricity consumption.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: videoconference using laptops and cameras for image and sound transmission. Band width: 0.7MBit/s. Consumer mix electricity consumption.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_621fd7a5-4db5-3a70-ba7e-c1bd20a5b843.xml</text>
